            <ArticleTitle>Complete Genome Sequence of a Novel Subgenotype of Porcine Reproductive and Respiratory Syndrome Virus Strain JX/CH/2016, Isolated in Jiangxi, China.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">e00980-17</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1128/genomeA.00980-17</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We sequenced the complete genome of porcine reproductive and respiratory syndrome virus (PRRSV) strain JX/CH/2016. Phylogenetic analysis based on the sequences of the open reading frame 5 (ORF5) gene revealed that this strain belongs to subgenotype IV. This is the first report of the complete genome sequence of PRRSV-IV.</AbstractText>
                <CopyrightInformation>Copyright © 2017 Zhang et al.</CopyrightInformation>
            </Abstract>
